{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text"]]},"metadata":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"monospacedDigit"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Text","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4TextV"}],"externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4TextV15monospacedDigitACyF","title":"monospacedDigit()","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","symbolKind":"method","modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI"},"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text\/monospacedDigit()"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"nonisolated"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"monospacedDigit"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4TextV","text":"Text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Return Value","anchor":"return-value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A text view with a modified font that uses fixed-width"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"numeric characters, while leaving other characters proportionally"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"spaced."}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This modifier only affects numeric characters, and leaves all other"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"characters unchanged."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The following example shows the effect of "},{"code":"monospacedDigit()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" on a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"text view. It arranges two text views in a "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/VStack"},{"type":"text","text":", each displaying"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"a formatted date that contains many instances of the character 1."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The second text view uses the "},{"code":"monospacedDigit()","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":". Because 1 is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"usually a narrow character in proportional fonts, applying the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modifier widens all of the 1s, and the text view as a whole."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"The non-digit characters in the text view remain unaffected."}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["let myDate = DateComponents(","    calendar: Calendar(identifier: .gregorian),","    timeZone: TimeZone(identifier: \"EST\"),","    year: 2011,","    month: 1,","    day: 11,","    hour: 11,","    minute: 11",").date!","","var body: some View {","    VStack(alignment: .leading) {","        Text(myDate.formatted(date: .long, time: .complete))","            .font(.system(size: 20))","        Text(myDate.formatted(date: .long, time: .complete))","            .font(.system(size: 20))","            .monospacedDigit()","    }","    .padding()","    .navigationTitle(\"monospacedDigit() Modifier\")","}"],"syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If the base font of the text view doesn’t support fixed-width digits,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the font remains unchanged."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/text\/monospaceddigit()"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Modifies the text view’s font to use fixed-width digits, while leaving"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"other characters proportionally spaced."}],"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/VStack":{"type":"topic","role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"VStack","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/VStack","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"VStack","kind":"identifier"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A view that arranges its subviews in a vertical line.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/vstack","title":"VStack","kind":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Text/monospacedDigit()":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"monospacedDigit"},{"kind":"text","text":"() -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Text","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI4TextV"}],"title":"monospacedDigit()","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/text\/monospaceddigit()","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Text\/monospacedDigit()","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Modifies the text view’s font to use fixed-width digits, while leaving","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"other characters proportionally spaced.","type":"text"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Text":{"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Text"}],"title":"Text","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":